{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790334120, "covers_from": "2026-09-25T11:02:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-25T11:03:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790334180, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-25T11:02:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 18773, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "公共安全", "content": "臺北路很小很擠，整天一堆違停，每個人都停一下整條路就被堵住。腳踏車道跟人行道規劃不全，常突然就斷掉。", "display_name": "大同代表 No.18,773", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T11:02:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 44217, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "交通", "content": "我希望搭公車的時候，公車司機可以等大家都坐穩跟站穩後再發車，現在每次一上車，都還沒有坐穩，司機就開車", "display_name": "士林代表 Lee ChiaHsuan Sandra", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T11:02:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 42066, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "教育", "content": "營養午餐政策是靠壓榨老師撐起來！是不當勞動行為，僱主在未與員工協商的情況下，直接增加勞務甚至剋扣薪籌", "display_name": "大安代表 No.42,066", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T11:02:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 15871, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "常看到剛畫好的斑馬線、人行道就被鋪柏油的工程車留下碾壓過的烏黑車輪痕跡，實在是很殘念又不美觀", "display_name": "文山代表 No.15,871", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 44217, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 Lee ChiaHsuan Sandra", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 42066, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.42,066", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 15871, "sprite_key": "beaver_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.15,871", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 22558, "spr